# id set labelstring
extension LABELSET 1
1 0 SLC
2 1 NAV
3 40 LIN
4 1 REV
5 1 SEG
6 0 AVG
7 0 REV
8 0 SEG
9 1 AVG
10 -1 LIN
11 0 NAV

